WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.280
"The Walking Dead" is a fan favorite show, and&nbsp;
once the most watched cable television series.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:10.320
Because of the series' longevity, viewers got to&nbsp;
watch as many characters aged before their eyes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.360
And after the show’s time jump in Season 9,&nbsp;
many younger characters were completely recast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.400
to reflect their drastic age changes, resulting&nbsp;
in some roles that have had multiple actors

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:25.200
Judith Grimes was born during "The Walking Dead"&nbsp;
Season 3, when Maggie performed an emergency&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.920
delivery, while the prison in which the survivors&nbsp;
were staying became overrun with zombies.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.000
Judith's mother Lori died in childbirth,&nbsp;
and Lori's husband Rick raised Judith&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.560
alongside his son, Carl. A total of&nbsp;
18 actors — many of them twin infants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:42.640
or babies — have played the character on&nbsp;
the show since Judith's first appearance.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.720
Twins Chloe and Sophia Garcia-Frizzi played Judith&nbsp;
as a toddler as she aged from Seasons 6 to 8,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:53.440
with Kinsley Isla Dillon taking over the&nbsp;
role as a 6-year-old Judith in Season 8.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:58.240
Following Rick's disappearance in Season 9,&nbsp;
the story experienced a six-year time jump,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.320
in which Judith aged, necessitating&nbsp;
the role's recasting. Cailey Fleming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:06.240
then took over the part and will&nbsp;
continue to play Judith in Season 11.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:09.600
Fleming is no stranger to&nbsp;
fans of genre TV and film.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.880
She played a young Rey in the last&nbsp;
two "Star Wars" movies — "The Force&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.360
Awakens" and "The Rise of Skywalker" — and&nbsp;
she recently played young Sylvie on "Loki."

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:21.360
Fleming's introduction as Judith is one&nbsp;
of the most memorable in the series.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:25.120
Aged by several years, Judith emerged&nbsp;
from the woods holding Rick's gun,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.080
carrying Michonne's katana,&nbsp;
and wearing Carl's hat.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.960
Since her big brother Carl's&nbsp;
death and Rick's disappearance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:34.160
Judith has been raised by Michonne&nbsp;
and her half-brother, R.J.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:39.200
and she's proven herself as capable of killing&nbsp;
zombies as her more experienced family members.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.400
Viewers first met 10-year-old Henry in Season&nbsp;
7. A member of The Kingdom, Henry was taken care&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.040
of by his older brother Benjamin, who was&nbsp;
murdered by a Savior during a supply run.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:53.680
On a mission for revenge, Henry insisted on&nbsp;
joining Carol in the fight against the Saviors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:57.760
proving himself a valuable member in&nbsp;
the battle against Negan. Henry, who was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:03.360
adopted by Ezekiel and Carol during the Season&nbsp;
9 time jump, was also known as "Prince Henry."

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.560
Initially portrayed by Macsen Lintz, Henry became&nbsp;
a 17-year-old young man seemingly overnight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.200
and Matt Lintz took over the&nbsp;
role from his younger brother.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:14.480
The Lintz family has a long history&nbsp;
with "The Walking Dead." Their sister,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.320
Madison Lintz, played Carol's&nbsp;
daughter, Sophia, in Seasons 1 and 2.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:22.320
The older Henry moved to the Hilltop&nbsp;
Colony, became a blacksmith's apprentice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:26.640
and fell in love with Lydia, a former&nbsp;
Whisperer whose mother, Alpha, disowned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:31.760
her after she formed a bond with Daryl Dixon and&nbsp;
others from the communities — including Henry.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:35.520
Alpha captured and killed Henry by&nbsp;
decapitation as a message to her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:39.520
daughter and the others, marking the end&nbsp;
of the Lintzes’ appearances on the show.

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:44.000
Few "Walking Dead" characters have been as beloved&nbsp;
as Glenn Rhee, whose death at the hands of Negan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.680
in Season 6 hit fans hard, and served a huge blow&nbsp;
to the show when fans found the scene outrageous.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:53.120
Fortunately, the character has lived&nbsp;
on through his son with wife Maggie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.800
Outside of ultrasound images, Hershel&nbsp;
Rhee made his first appearance on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:01.760
show in Season 9 as a baby, only to age&nbsp;
six years after Rick's supposed death.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:05.440
“He’s just perfect. He really is.”

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:09.520
Maggie and Hershel left Hilltop for Georgie's&nbsp;
group so they wouldn't be near Negan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:13.200
but they're expected to play a large&nbsp;
part in the upcoming final season.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:17.120
During his time on the show, young Hershel&nbsp;
has been portrayed by three actors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:22.240
including Peyton Lockridge in Season 9 and&nbsp;
the most recent actor, Kien Michael Spiller.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.760
The young boy wears a hat reminiscent&nbsp;
of Glenn's from Season 1 and 2,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:29.040
and he seems to have a gentle&nbsp;
nature, just like his grandfather.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:33.360
Only time will tell what the future holds for the&nbsp;
son of one of the show's most popular couples.

